f0\\}\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f222b74804c56f9b\" href=\"?note=f222b74804c56f9b\" title=\"20-thm-dekker\">20-thm-dekker</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hypersimple\\text{-}degrees}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hypersimple\\text{-}degrees}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对任意非可计算 c.e. 代表取缺陷集。该结果不会说每个代表元都超简单。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 5.3.7；印刷页 116；PDF 第 151 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-dekker","status":"resolved","id":"f222b74804c56f9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-dekker]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-dekker","status":"resolved","id":"f222b74804c56f9b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-dekker]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-dekker]]；see [[20-df-r